# Production Backend URL (Render)
# When deploying to Vercel, add this key in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables
# Example: https://mindease-backend.onrender.com
# For local development with Vite proxy, leave empty or unset.
VITE_API_URL=

# Google OAuth Client ID (Optional)
# For production Google Sign-In with your own Google Cloud Console project:
# 1. Create a Web OAuth 2.0 Client ID in Google Cloud Console
# 2. Add your domain (e.g., https://your-project.vercel.app, http://localhost:5173) to Authorized Javascript Origins
# 3. Paste the client ID below. If left empty, MindEase provides an instant zero-config Google 1-tap chooser!
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

